      "title_at_revision": "One-wheel landing conditions",
      "text": "For the one-wheel landing condition, the rotorcraft is assumed to be in the level attitude and to contact the ground on one aft wheel. In this attitude:\n(a) The vertical load must be the same as that obtained on that side under CS 27.479(b)(l); and\n(b) The unbalanced external loads must be reacted by rotorcraft inertia.",
